  "laws": [
    "THE SAME MACHINE IN EVERY STATE: body, base, dial, needle and both glyphs never change between states or between founders; only needle position, glow and output change.",
    "NEEDLE POSITIONS: STEADY = upright at mid-dial; ROAR = hard right at the winged-block end; COLD = hard left at the snail end.",
    "COLD IS A DARK VERSION OF THIS MACHINE, never an absence: engine dark and untouched, no glow, no hum lines, still whole.",
    "PROPORTIONS PINNED: dial diameter is roughly HALF the body width; the machine is waist-high to an adult figure in every frame that shows both.",
    "INK OUTLINES, FLAT CREAM FILLS, terracotta-compatible; NEVER photoreal, neo-comic, HUD, neon, 3D/CGI/Pixar, or glossy plastic.",
    "NO LETTERING, NUMBERS OR SCALE MARKINGS on the dial: only the snail mark (left) and the winged-block mark (right)."
